# The lab's local-only layer: era-1 harness (disposable, holds its own
# node_modules), capture staging, and sandbox App credentials. Tracked:
# protocols/, src/, test/. Reviewed captures go STRAIGHT to
# testkit/fixtures/, reaching their packages through the testkit's
# exports — see lab/README.md and D88.
packages/lab/harness/
packages/lab/evidence/
packages/lab/.env
node_modules/
.stryker-tmp/
coverage/
reports/

# The shell's operational home: SQLite store, the operator's config copy,
# and the decision journal. Local state, never tracked.
packages/shell/data/
